  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_5485.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La noche de este viernes se ha celebrado en el barrio San Joaqu&iacute;n de Onda la cena popular, para coger fuerzas y encarar el &uacute;ltimo fin de semana festivo, con toros este s&aacute;bado, y paella y pasacalle final para el domingo.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparsegondivendressantjoaquim13/img_5483.jpg\" alt=\"img_5483\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparsegondivendressantjoaquim13/img_5484.jpg\" alt=\"img_5484\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparsegondivendressantjoaquim13/img_5485.jpg\" alt=\"img_5485\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparsegondivendressantjoaquim13/img_5486.jpg\" alt=\"img_5486\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparsegondivendressantjoaquim13/img_5487.jpg\" alt=\"img_5487\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparsegondivendressantjoaquim13/img_5488.jpg\" alt=\"img_5488\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparsegondivendressantjoaquim13/img_5489.jpg\" alt=\"img_5489\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparsegondivendressantjoaquim13/img_5490.jpg\" alt=\"img_5490\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparsegondivendressantjoaquim13/img_5491.jpg\" alt=\"img_5491\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:aut